SUMMARY:PAPERBACK RELEASE: Adriana Trigiani 'The View from Lake Como'
DESCRIPTION:Released just in time for summer! \nThe Montclair Literary Festival invites you to join beloved bestselling author Adriana Trigiani in conversation with Mark Rotella (Stolen Figs\, Amore) about her latest novel The View From Lake Como on Wednesday May 6 at 7pm. \nShocked by an unexpected loss\, Jess Capodimonte Baratta takes fate into her own hands and escapes from New Jersey to her ancestral home in Italy. \nFrom the majestic mountains of Tuscany and on the shores of enchanting Lake Como\, she begins to carve a place for herself. \nIn collaboration with the Coccia Institute for the Italian Experience in America. \nTickets to hear Adriana in person are $25 and include a signed copy of The View from Lake Como. Adriana will be signing books after the talk. \nThe event will be held at the Unitarian Universalist Congregation at Montclair\, 67 Church St\, Montclair. Buy tickets here bit.ly/MLF-Lake. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/paperback-release-adriana-trigiani-the-view-from-lake-como/
