SUMMARY:Mayfair - Nishuane
DESCRIPTION:Spanning the Nishuane playing field\, playground\, and parking lot\, Mayfair is a fun-filled family festival with activities for kids 2+\, including arts and crafts\, bouncy houses\, face painting\, rides\, food\, and more. A Montclair favorite and Nishuane’s biggest fundraiser for over 30 years. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
